---
---
<figure class="widget ln" data-ln data-mode="before">
  <div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Layout">
    <button type="button" data-set="before" aria-pressed="true">What agents make</button>
    <button type="button" data-set="after" aria-pressed="false">After the one-liner</button>
  </div>
  <div class="mock" aria-label="Example page section">
    <p class="eyebrow noise">ABOUT ME</p>
    <h3>Streets people actually want to walk</h3>
    <p class="tag noise">Passionate researcher · Data enthusiast · Lifelong learner</p>
    <p class="body">I map how people move through neighbourhoods and turn it into small changes a council can afford. Before that I spent six years in transport research.</p>
    <div class="facts">
      <div><span class="lab noise">LOCATION</span><b>Lisbon</b><small class="noise">Where I'm based</small></div>
      <div><span class="lab noise">FOCUS</span><b>Pedestrian data</b><small class="noise">My main area</small></div>
    </div>
    <p class="help noise">Scroll down to explore my journey ↓</p>
  </div>
  <pre class="prompt"><code>Cut taglines, helper text, and secondary labels. If a screen needs them to make sense, fix the layout instead.</code></pre>
  <figcaption class="caption">The tiny uppercase label above every headline, the tagline under every title, a hint on every element. It looks designed and reads as noise.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .mock { background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.2rem; margin: 1rem 0; font-family: var(--serif); }
  .mock h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; line-height: 1.15; }
  .body { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--ink-2); margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.6rem; }
  .facts div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-top: 0.5rem; }
  .facts b { font-weight: 500; }
  .noise { overflow: hidden; transition: opacity 260ms ease, max-height 300ms ease, margin 300ms ease; max-height: 3em; }
  .eyebrow { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--accent); margin: 0 0 0.4rem; }
  .tag { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 0.8rem; }
  .lab { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--muted); }
  small { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.62rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .help { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 1rem 0 0; text-align: center; }
  [data-mode='after'] .noise { opacity: 0; max-height: 0; margin: 0; }
  .prompt { margin: 0; white-space: pre-wrap; }
</style>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-ln]').forEach((root) => {
    root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-set]').forEach((b) =>
      b.addEventListener('click', () => {
        root.dataset.mode = b.dataset.set!;
        root.querySelectorAll('[data-set]').forEach((x) => x.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(x === b)));
      }),
    );
  });
</script>
